<p>The position key <strong>k_t^R</strong> is shared across all 128 attention heads — it doesn't need a per-head copy. This is what keeps its cache cost low. Total cache per token: 512 (content latent) + 64 (position key) = <strong>576 floats</strong>.</p>
</section>

